---
// Site-wide notice while helmstudio is in alpha. Used by the home/Tour layout and, via the Banner override, every docs page.
---
<div class="alpha-banner" role="note" data-pagefind-ignore>
  <b>Alpha</b> · helmstudio is early software: things will change, and some will break. <a href="/start/whats-new/">What's new</a> · <a href="https://github.com/janishar/helmstudio/issues">Report an issue</a>
</div>

<style>
  .alpha-banner {
    padding: 8px 16px;
    background: var(--a1, var(--hs-a1));
    color: var(--on1, var(--hs-on1));
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.4;
    text-align: center;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }
  .alpha-banner b { font-weight: 700; }
  .alpha-banner a { color: inherit; text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 2px; }
</style>
